{"ref":"BDB, שָׁרַק","hw":"שָׁרַק","html":"† <big><big><span dir=\"rtl\">שָׁרַק</span></big></big>  <strong>vb. hiss</strong>, perhaps also <strong>whistle, pipe (</strong>NH id., <em>hiss</em> (dub.), Aramaic <span dir=\"rtl\">שְׁרֵיק</span> id. 𝔗 <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 2:15\" href=\"/Leviticus.2.15\">Lv 2:15</a>, <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 2:16\" href=\"/Leviticus.2.16\">16</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">ܫܪܳܩ</span> id.<em>;</em>—from <span dir=\"rtl\">שׁ׳</span> comes Gk. σῦριγξ according to Lag <sup>Abh GGW xxvi. 38</sup> Lewy<sup>Fremdw. 165</sup><strong>)</strong>;—<br><strong>Qal</strong>  Pf. 3 ms. consec. <span dir=\"rtl\">וְשׁ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 5:26\" href=\"/Isaiah.5.26\">Is 5:26</a>, etc.; Impf. 3 ms. <span dir=\"rtl\">יִשְׁרֹק</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 7:18\" href=\"/Isaiah.7.18\">Is 7:18</a> + (<a data-ref=\"Job 27:23\" href=\"/Job.27.23\">Jb 27:23</a> read <span dir=\"rtl\">יִשְׁרְקוּ</span> Me Bi Siegf Bu); 1 s. <span dir=\"rtl\">אֶשְׁרְקָה</span> <a data-ref=\"Zechariah 10:8\" href=\"/Zechariah.10.8\">Zc 10:8</a>;—<em>hiss</em>, as signal, ל pers., fig., <span dir=\"rtl\">י׳</span> subj.: <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 5:26\" href=\"/Isaiah.5.26\">Is 5:26</a>; <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 7:18\" href=\"/Isaiah.7.18\">7:18</a>; <a data-ref=\"Zechariah 10:1\" href=\"/Zechariah.10.1\">Zc 10:1</a>; in derision, <span dir=\"rtl\">עַל</span> civitat., etc. (often + <span dir=\"rtl\">שָׁמֵם</span> <em>be astounded</em>), <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 19:8\" href=\"/Jeremiah.19.8\">Je 19:8</a>; <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 49:17\" href=\"/Jeremiah.49.17\">49:17</a>; <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 50:13\" href=\"/Jeremiah.50.13\">50:13</a>; <a data-ref=\"Lamentations 2:15\" href=\"/Lamentations.2.15\">La 2:15</a> (+ <span dir=\"rtl\">הֵנִיעַ רֹאשׁ</span>), <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 27:36\" href=\"/Ezekiel.27.36\">Ez 27:36</a>; abs. <a data-ref=\"Zephaniah 2:15\" href=\"/Zephaniah.2.15\">Zp 2:15</a>; <a data-ref=\"Lamentations 2:16\" href=\"/Lamentations.2.16\">La 2:16</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Kings 9:8\" href=\"/I_Kings.9.8\">1 K 9:8</a> (+ <span dir=\"rtl\">חָרַק שֵׁן</span>); <span dir=\"rtl\">עַל</span> pers. <a data-ref=\"Job 27:23\" href=\"/Job.27.23\">Jb 27:23</a> (c. <span dir=\"rtl\">מִן</span> loc.).","next":"BDB, שְׁרֵקָה","prev":"BDB, שֶׁ֫רֶץ"}